t; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">&ldquo;4 Steps to Affiliate Success\"</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">1. Sign Up: Receive your affiliate link.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">2. Promote: Feature branded products on YouTube and social media.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">3. Earn: Make profits on every purchase.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">4. Collaborate: Share and promote fellow YouTubers&rsquo; brands for more reach.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">\"Grow Together with SA&rsquo;s YouTube Community\"</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">Cross-promote with other South African creators.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">Access an exclusive Shopify store just for SA YouTubers.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">Earn as you support each other&rsquo;s brands.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 107%; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">\"Join Today and Start Earning with Your